                "text": "Thanks to our work on the budget package, Ohio hospitals can now get reimbursed 24% more for the care they deliver to Medicaid patients, and our rural hospitals are going to see more federal dollars than ever before.\n\u00a0\nOur $50B investment in a transformational rural hospital fund means historic levels of support for these Ohio providers.",
